meta {
  name: saveTradeItemTranslation
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveTradeItemTranslation",
    "params": {
      "trade_item_id": 456,
      "language": "nl",
      "trade_item_description": "Nieuwe omschrijving",
      "add_to_changes": true
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Save or propose translated text for an existing trade item; does not change translation inheritance

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `add_to_changes` | boolean | no | Queue an update for review instead of publishing |
  | `trade_item_id` | integer | yes | Internal ID of the existing trade item |
  | `language` | string | yes | BCP 47 language code (e.g. nl, nl-BE) |
  | `context_id` | integer | no | Channel context ID; defaults to 1 |
  | `trade_item_description` | string (nullable) | no |  |
  | `trade_item_long_description` | string (nullable) | no |  |
  | `trade_item_marketing_text` | string (nullable) | no |  |
  | `trade_item_web_text` | string (nullable) | no |  |

  **Example: Propose Dutch trade item text**. Without add_to_changes, a publishing client receives outcome=applied and change_request_id=null. A no-op proposal returns outcome=no_changes and change_request_id=null.

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveTradeItemTranslation",
    "params": {
      "trade_item_id": 456,
      "language": "nl",
      "trade_item_description": "Nieuwe omschrijving",
      "add_to_changes": true
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "trade_item_id": 456,
    "language": "nl",
    "context_id": 1,
    "outcome": "queued_for_review",
    "change_request_id": 42
  }
  ```
}
